WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.434 --> 00:00:03.391
Unit six. Social Justice!

2
00:00:04.506 --> 00:00:10.747
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level six!

3
00:00:10.797 --> 00:00:14.242
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:17.994
Today we learn: Social Justice. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.496 --> 00:00:23.246
Equity. Say it with me. Equity!

6
00:00:26.728 --> 00:00:31.795
Systemic inequality. Say it with me. Systemic inequality!

7
00:00:35.305 --> 00:00:39.805
Marginalized group. Say it with me. Marginalized group!

8
00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:47.436
Human rights. Say it with me. Human rights!

9
00:00:50.995 --> 00:00:55.629
Advocacy campaign. Say it with me. Advocacy campaign!

10
00:00:59.128 --> 00:01:03.461
Discrimination. Say it with me. Discrimination!

11
00:01:06.953 --> 00:01:11.036
Social movement. Say it with me. Social movement!

12
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.583
Inclusive policy. Say it with me. Inclusive policy!

13
00:01:23.131 --> 00:01:26.715
Empowerment. Say it with me. Empowerment!

14
00:01:30.229 --> 00:01:34.779
Representation. Say it with me. Representation!

15
00:01:38.266 --> 00:01:42.099
Allyship. Say it with me. Allyship!

16
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:50.013
Structural change. Say it with me. Structural change!

17
00:01:53.553 --> 00:02:05.210
Grammar time! Passive voice for systemic issues. Listen. Inequality is caused by structural barriers that must be addressed.

18
00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:12.396
Your turn. Say it with me. Inequality is caused by structural barriers that must be addressed.

19
00:02:17.191 --> 00:02:27.528
Equity means addressing systemic inequality faced by marginalized groups. Advocacy campaigns and allyship push for inclusive policy and structural change.

20
00:02:27.578 --> 00:02:29.081
I like this story!

21
00:02:30.203 --> 00:02:35.453
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:35.503 --> 00:02:37.095
Marginalized group!

23
00:02:38.102 --> 00:02:43.194
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:43.244 --> 00:02:44.588
Social movement!

25
00:02:45.584 --> 00:02:54.645
Think and answer. What social justice issue matters most to you and why?

26
00:02:54.695 --> 00:02:55.845
Great answer!

27
00:02:56.961 --> 00:03:01.684
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:03:01.734 --> 00:03:03.410
Bye-bye, friends!

